    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 3.92,
      "end": 4.42,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 5.38,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 6.2,
      "end": 9.06,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you another great lesson about appointments.",
      "zh": "今天我们将为你带来另一个关于预约的精彩课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 9.92,
      "end": 10.92,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 10.92,
      "end": 13.98,
      "en": "We've got an elementary lesson about cancelling an appointment.",
      "zh": "我们有一节关于取消预约的初级课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 15.12,
      "end": 16.8,
      "en": "It's a really common situation sometimes.",
      "zh": "有时这是一个非常普遍的情况。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 17.46,
      "end": 19.66,
      "en": "You have an appointment at the doctor's or something.",
      "zh": "你有预约医生之类的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 19.92,
      "end": 20.22,
      "en": "Or at work.",
      "zh": "或在工作中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 21.16,
      "end": 21.98,
      "en": "And you have to cancel it.",
      "zh": "你必须取消它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 22.16,
      "end": 23.16,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 23.16,
      "end": 26.26,
      "en": "So we're going to learn some great language to help you cancel appointments today.",
      "zh": "所以今天我们将学习一些实用表达，帮你取消预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 28.44,
      "en": "Let's go straight to the dialogue then.",
      "zh": "那么让我们直接进入对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 28.8,
      "end": 32.58,
      "en": "We're going to be listening as Samantha and Angela have a phone conversation.",
      "zh": "我们将在萨曼莎和安吉拉进行电话交谈时聆听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 32.58,
      "end": 35.64,
      "en": "And Angela is trying to cancel an appointment.",
      "zh": "安吉拉正想取消一个预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 36.16,
      "end": 37.92,
      "en": "And it's going to be a little bit fast in the beginning.",
      "zh": "一开始它会有点快。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 41.32,
      "en": "But when we come back, we will explain all the great vocabulary.",
      "zh": "但是当我们回来时，我们将解释所有伟大的词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 42.64,
      "end": 46.64,
      "en": "Hello, Samantha speaking.",
      "zh": "你好，我是萨曼莎。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 46.64,
      "end": 49.64,
      "en": "Hi, Samantha.",
      "zh": "你好，萨曼莎。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 49.64,
      "end": 55.64,
      "en": "This is Angela calling.",
      "zh": "我是安杰拉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 55.64,
      "end": 58.64,
      "en": "Oh, hi, Angela.",
      "zh": "哦，你好，安杰拉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 58.76,
      "end": 58.96,
      "en": "What's up?",
      "zh": "最近怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 59.37,
      "end": 61.25,
      "en": "I'm just calling about our meeting today.",
      "zh": "我打电话是想说说今天的会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 62.09,
      "end": 65.69,
      "en": "I wonder, is it possible to reschedule our appointment in the afternoon?",
      "zh": "今天下午的会能改个时间吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 66.25,
      "end": 69.09,
      "en": "I have a bit of an emergency that I need to take care of.",
      "zh": "我有件急事要处理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 69.72,
      "end": 70.44,
      "en": "Let me see.",
      "zh": "让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 70.64,
      "end": 72.64,
      "en": "It shouldn't be too much of a problem.",
      "zh": "应该没什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 72.69,
      "end": 73.55,
      "en": "I'm really sorry.",
