      "start": 308.0,
      "end": 310.5,
      "en": "So, this is a very common way of saying hi.",
      "zh": "所以，这是一个非常常见的打招呼方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 311.02,
      "end": 311.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 311.54,
      "end": 311.74,
      "en": "What's up?",
      "zh": "最近怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 312.14,
      "end": 312.62,
      "en": "How's it going?",
      "zh": "最近怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "start": 312.92,
      "end": 313.46,
      "en": "What's going on?",
      "zh": "怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "start": 313.84,
      "end": 318.02,
      "en": "Right, and now the interesting thing is that many people don't know how to answer this phrase.",
      "zh": "对，现在有趣的是，很多人不知道如何回答这个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "start": 318.38,
      "end": 320.36,
      "en": "Yes, I see this all the time with my students.",
      "zh": "对，我的学生就经常这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "start": 320.54,
      "end": 322.7,
      "en": "So, if you say what's up, you should say…",
      "zh": "所以，如果有人对你说 what's up，你应该说……"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "start": 323.24,
      "end": 323.6,
      "en": "Not much.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "start": 323.64,
      "end": 324.64,
      "en": "Not much.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "start": 324.64,
      "end": 325.06,
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 325.64,
      "end": 326.64,
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 326.64,
      "end": 327.64,
      "en": "So, what's up?",
      "zh": "那么，最近怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 327.64,
      "end": 328.64,
      "en": "Not much.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "start": 328.64,
      "end": 329.64,
      "en": "Not much.",
      "zh": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "start": 329.64,
      "end": 332.64,
      "en": "Alright, so the next time someone tells you what's up, now you know what to answer.",
      "zh": "好，那下次有人对你说 what's up 时，你就知道该怎么回答了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "start": 332.64,
      "end": 333.64,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 333.64,
      "end": 336.28,
      "en": "Okay, our second phrase is can't make it.",
      "zh": "好，我们的第二个短语是 can't make it。"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 336.66,
      "end": 337.78,
      "en": "Can't make it.",
      "zh": "去不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 338.16,
      "end": 339.24,
      "en": "I can't make it.",
      "zh": "我去不了了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 339.54,
      "end": 342.46,
      "en": "We use this phrase when we want to say I cannot attend.",
      "zh": "当我们想说我不能参加时，我们会使用这句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 342.84,
      "end": 343.72,
      "en": "I cannot make it.",
      "zh": "我去不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 343.82,
      "end": 344.64,
      "en": "Yeah, I can't come.",
      "zh": "是的，我不能来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 345.3,
      "end": 349.22,
      "en": "Right, so if you're having a party today, I say, oh, I'm sorry, I can't make it.",
      "zh": "对，所以如果你今天要开派对，我会说，哦，对不起，我去不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 349.64,
      "end": 350.94,
      "en": "It means I can't go.",
      "zh": "这意味着我不能去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 351.64,
      "end": 352.64,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 352.64,
      "end": 353.64,
      "en": "Maybe one more example.",
      "zh": "也许可以再举个例子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 353.64,
      "end": 355.64,
      "en": "So, Marco, we've got a meeting today at three o'clock.",
      "zh": "所以，马可，我们今天三点开会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 356.25,
      "end": 357.13,
      "en": "I can't make it.",
      "zh": "我去不了了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 357.37,
      "end": 358.13,
      "en": "I'm recording today.",
      "zh": "我今天在录。"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 358.35,
      "end": 358.99,
      "en": "Oh, okay.",
      "zh": "哦，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 359.79,
      "end": 361.19,
      "en": "So, can't make it.",
      "zh": "所以，就是 can't make it（去不了）。"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 361.64,
      "end": 365.64,
      "en": "Our last word for fluency builder, this thing came up.",
      "zh": "我们流利表达的最后一个短语，this thing came up。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 365.64,
      "end": 366.85,
      "en": "This thing came up.",
      "zh": "临时出了这件事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 367.64,
      "end": 368.79,
      "en": "This thing came up.",
      "zh": "临时出了这件事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 369.64,
      "end": 373.64,
      "en": "This is a great way of giving an excuse for why you can't make it to an event.",
      "zh": "这是为您无法参加活动提供借口的好方法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 373.64,
      "end": 374.64,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 374.64,
      "end": 377.45,
      "en": "So, I can't make it today because this thing came up.",
      "zh": "所以，我今天去不了了，因为临时有事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 377.64,
      "end": 378.64,
      "en": "Like, something…",
      "zh": "比如，某事…"
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 378.77,
      "end": 379.37,
      "en": "Something happened.",
      "zh": "发生了点事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 379.64,
      "end": 380.64,
      "en": "Something happened.",
      "zh": "发生了点事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "start": 380.64,
      "end": 381.64,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 156,
      "start": 381.64,
      "end": 385.09,
      "en": "Let's listen to a few examples of this phrase so we can see how it's used in the wild.",
      "zh": "我们听几个这个短语的例子，看看它在实际生活中是怎么用的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "start": 385.64,
      "end": 387.64,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "start": 387.64,
      "end": 394.64,
      "en": "I'm sorry that I'm late, this thing came up at work and I had to stay to take care of it.",
      "zh": "很抱歉我迟到了，工作上临时有事，我不得不留下来处理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 159,
      "start": 395.68,
      "end": 396.44,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "start": 398.64,
      "end": 399.64,
      "en": "I can't talk right now.",
      "zh": "我现在不能说话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 161,
      "start": 400.02,
      "end": 400.58,
      "en": "Something came up.",
      "zh": "临时有事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "start": 403.64,
      "end": 406.64,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 407.15,
      "end": 408.17,
      "en": "Sorry I missed the meeting.",
      "zh": "对不起，我错过了会议。"
    },
    {
      "id": 164,
      "start": 408.17,
      "end": 409.09,
      "en": "Something came up.",
      "zh": "临时有事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 165,
      "start": 411.83,
      "end": 414.87,
      "en": "Okay, great example and I guess it's perfectly clear now.",
      "zh": "好的，很好的例子，我想现在已经很清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 415.03,
      "end": 415.33,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "start": 415.79,
      "end": 419.75,
      "en": "So, let's listen to our dialogue a third time and now we're ready to understand everything.",
      "zh": "所以，让我们第三次听我们的对话，现在我们已经准备好了解一切了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "start": 447.33,
      "end": 448.43,
      "en": "I'm really sorry.",
      "zh": "我真的很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "start": 449.05,
      "end": 451.25,
      "en": "I hope it doesn't inconvenience you too much.",
      "zh": "我希望它不会给你带来太多不便。"
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "start": 451.83,
      "end": 453.83,
      "en": "It's just this thing came up and…",
      "zh": "只是这件事出现了，......"
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 459.71,
      "end": 460.27,
      "en": "Sounds great.",
      "zh": "听起来很棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "start": 481.8,
      "end": 486.04,
      "en": "So, Erica, have you ever cancelled an appointment like this under false pretenses?",
      "zh": "那么，埃里卡，你有没有以虚假借口取消过这样的预约？"
    },
    {
      "id": 173,
      "start": 486.82,
      "end": 489.38,
      "en": "So, for a fake reason?",
      "zh": "那么，出于虚假的原因？"
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "start": 489.64,
      "end": 491.5,
      "en": "For a fake reason to go shopping?",
      "zh": "虚假的理由去购物？"
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 493.3,
      "end": 500.14,
      "en": "I may not have told my boss so I can't make it to a meeting because this thing came up and then I really was going shopping.",
      "zh": "我可能跟老板说因为临时有事去不了会，其实我是去逛街了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "start": 500.64,
      "end": 501.54,
      "en": "I've never done that.",
      "zh": "我从来没有这样做过。"
    },
    {
      "id": 177,
      "start": 501.74,
      "end": 502.48,
      "en": "But how about you, Marco?",
      "zh": "但是你呢，马可？"
    },
    {
      "id": 178,
      "start": 503.1,
      "end": 505.4,
      "en": "Well, you know, in Ecuador, soccer is a really big thing.",
      "zh": "嗯，你知道，在厄瓜多尔，足球是一件非常大的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 179,
      "start": 505.68,
      "end": 505.8,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "start": 506.64,
      "end": 509.64,
      "en": "So, when we were playing in the World Cup, Ecuador was playing and…",
      "zh": "所以，当世界杯开赛时，厄瓜多尔队正在比赛，然后……"
    },
    {
      "id": 181,
      "start": 510.4,
      "end": 511.22,
      "en": "Not you, but…",
      "zh": "不是你，而是…"
    },
    {
      "id": 182,
      "start": 511.22,
      "end": 514.08,
      "en": "Well, no, like the Ecuadorian soccer team.",
      "zh": "不，是说厄瓜多尔国家足球队。"
    },
    {
      "id": 183,
      "start": 514.64,
      "end": 517.64,
      "en": "I cancelled an appointment because I was going to go watch the game.",
      "zh": "我取消了一个预约，因为我要去看比赛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 184,
      "start": 518.12,
      "end": 518.26,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 185,
      "start": 518.64,
      "end": 518.94,
      "en": "A business appointment.",
      "zh": "商务预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 186,
      "start": 519.64,
      "end": 519.98,
      "en": "A business appointment.",
      "zh": "商务预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 187,
      "start": 520.64,
      "end": 521.42,
      "en": "Well, I guess that's okay.",
      "zh": "嗯，我想没关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 188,
      "start": 522.04,
      "end": 530.24,
      "en": "Yeah, I mean, it was like the first time we were ever in the World Cup and, you know, my boss didn't really put up much of a fight because I guess he also wanted to go watch the game.",
      "zh": "是的，这是我们第一次参加世界杯，你知道，我老板也没怎么反对，因为我猜他也想去看比赛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 189,
      "start": 530.42,
      "end": 533.12,
      "en": "So, very similar to the events in this dialogue.",
      "zh": "所以，与这次对话中的事件非常相似。"
    },
    {
      "id": 190,
      "start": 533.64,
      "end": 534.64,
      "en": "Very similar.",
      "zh": "非常相似。"
    },
    {
      "id": 191,
      "start": 534.64,
      "end": 536.64,
      "en": "I guess that's kind of the inspiration behind it.",
      "zh": "我想这就是它背后的灵感。"
    },
    {
      "id": 192,
      "start": 536.64,
      "end": 537.64,
      "en": "All right, guys.",
      "zh": "好了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 193,
      "start": 537.82,
      "end": 540.56,
      "en": "I hope you found some of these phrases helpful and useful.",
      "zh": "希望这些短语对你有所帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "start": 540.64,
      "end": 548.64,
      "en": "And remember, if you have any questions about anything you heard in today's lesson, please visit our website at EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "请记住，如果您对今天课程中听到的任何内容有任何疑问，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 195,
      "start": 548.89,
      "end": 549.13,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 196,
      "start": 549.19,
      "end": 554.67,
      "en": "There you'll be able to find more resources and also a large community to interact with.",
      "zh": "在那里，您将能够找到更多资源以及与之互动的大型社区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 197,
      "start": 554.87,
      "end": 556.31,
      "en": "Yes, including me and Marco.",
      "zh": "是的，包括我和马可。"
    },
    {
      "id": 198,
      "start": 556.53,
      "end": 556.67,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 199,
      "start": 557.64,
      "end": 558.64,
      "en": "So, we'll see you there.",
      "zh": "所以，我们会在那里见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "start": 558.64,
      "end": 559.45,
      "en": "Until then, it's…",
      "zh": "在那之前，它是…"
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "start": 559.64,
      "end": 560.64,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
